<title>USA: Kimberly-Clark sees H2 oper shr matching H1.</title>
<headline>Kimberly-Clark sees H2 oper shr matching H1.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimberly-Clark Corp said Monday its earnings from operations for the second-half of the year &quot;will likely be in the same ballpark&quot; as the first half.</p>
<p>The company reported an income of $715 million, or $1.28 a share, for the first six months of 1997, excluding an extraordinary gain of $17.5 million, or $0.03 a share.</p>
</text>
